B$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix too. \n\nTherefore, the multiplication is well defined and \n\n$$\n{I}_{2}\\cdot B=B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101142 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "90412f20-4e0b-5b47-9010-888ec3e2cb1e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The product is undefined" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098188} {:answer/id #uuid "edf67f8b-9d4a-5747-aaa1-0833598f0c2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098189} {:answer/id #uuid "041634d6-335d-562c-a297-a01d34c992cb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098190} {:answer/id #uuid "15495e07-3f54-59d0-bec4-eda60d391b44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098191} {:answer/id #uuid "6d98e14e-ae11-5a04-9022-41ec5d068c87" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -3 & -4 \\\\ -1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -2 & -8 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098192}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "15495e07-3f54-59d0-bec4-eda60d391b44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098191} :answer-field/id #uuid "36cb859b-820d-5463-996a-ae99844021b5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186098187}] :question/id #uuid "a8a24b2e-f6ed-50cf-9604-526d047e9b20" :question/math-academy-id "q-13763" :question/problem "Calculate the product $AI_{3}$ given that $I_{3}$ is the $3 \\times 3$ identity matrix and\n$$\n\\displaystyle A = \\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying a matrix by the corresponding identity matrix leaves every entry unchanged. Both matrices are $3\\times3$, so the product is defined.\n\n$$\nAI_3=A=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101407 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e77b0e35-b8ea-5618-ab6c-8503315df0e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3.5 \\\\ -2.5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392443} {:answer/id #uuid "b90bbe8b-d8e5-5080-9aa2-4142743a4b96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392444} {:answer/id #uuid "6b52aa96-4f70-58ea-b2cf-28f779b7b43b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2\\sqrt{5} & -2.5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392445} {:answer/id #uuid "d06d67b6-8acb-58a8-957c-d55d012736a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392446} {:answer/id #uuid "e47cb90f-8189-59b3-96b0-469513eb54fc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} & -3 & 3.5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392447}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b90bbe8b-d8e5-5080-9aa2-4142743a4b96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392444} :answer-field/id #uuid "3cb1f592-094a-5b91-bac8-80971fe96ac3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392442}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "bde0cdd0-7dbe-5ba4-9b36-e66cfe099501" :question/math-academy-id "q-41949" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} & -3 & 3.5 \\\\ -2 & 2\\sqrt{5} & -2.5 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand \n$$\n\\displaystyle B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $1$st *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $1$st *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $1$st *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} & -3 & 3.5 \\\\ -2 & 2\\sqrt{5} & -2.5 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7}\\cdot 1+(-3)\\cdot 0+3.5\\cdot 0 \\\\ (-2)\\cdot 1+2\\sqrt{5}\\cdot 0+(-2.5)\\cdot 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\cdot 1+4\\cdot 0+5\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101408 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "be5f5e04-2f01-53f2-8591-c58133cd71f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ \\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099610} {:answer/id #uuid "cea56a00-7b9a-582e-bb36-014f084a08d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099611} {:answer/id #uuid "19e549cb-f70f-5feb-a295-b0871f09f0a1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{3} \\\\ -3.2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099612} {:answer/id #uuid "481625fa-4152-5af0-8d28-f2e247bb3b2b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099613} {:answer/id #uuid "7c7fffdb-3c6f-5a99-b9d5-1823e4a8b907" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099614}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "481625fa-4152-5af0-8d28-f2e247bb3b2b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099613} :answer-field/id #uuid "58019043-5b9b-509d-bec2-1f0d3fe2ba2b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099609}] :question/id #uuid "05da9b48-a1ff-5fcf-a365-aa02a133b9d8" :question/math-academy-id "q-41950" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle A = \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\n\\displaystyle B = \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3} \\\\ -3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$ is the third row of $I_3$. Multiplying $B$ on the left by this row selects the third row of $B$. Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265862 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "37062ec7-152b-5164-a3d0-355f27db1080" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263493} {:answer/id #uuid "40fdd066-50a9-56e1-9f21-38c1bf8770b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263575} {:answer/id #uuid "4c4047fd-6f9f-5f76-8868-a821b02a6022" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263661} {:answer/id #uuid "e0ad76de-ec95-57ff-9298-b293f98b1ef8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264951} {:answer/id #uuid "fc48ca66-d443-578e-9379-fa3ec3e3dd04" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265213}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e0ad76de-ec95-57ff-9298-b293f98b1ef8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264951} :answer-field/id #uuid "241201b7-ee2f-5818-8a2b-dbb615d80d37" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265310}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "797519b5-ee4f-5bc0-bbbc-671debb4c9ad" :question/math-academy-id "q-130243" :question/problem "Calculate the product $A{I}_{2}$ given that ${I}_{2}$ is the $2\\times 2$ identity matrix and\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Any matrix, when multiplied by an identity matrix, remains unchanged (assuming that the multiplication is well defined).\n\nThe matrix $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix and ${I}_{2}$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix too. \n\nTherefore, the multiplication is well defined and \n\n$$\nA\\cdot {I}_{2}=A=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265864 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13fee5aa-433b-519c-a879-d278aa8a48f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263188} {:answer/id #uuid "41aaa268-3659-536e-98cb-3962c98cba4f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263581} {:answer/id #uuid "4b7ae9d8-1791-5400-b198-890be82afcf7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263650} {:answer/id #uuid "51369c57-0490-5682-9521-7d30dfd3b175" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263705} {:answer/id #uuid "b8683bd6-23f6-5798-b795-d12c220d0f7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264594}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "13fee5aa-433b-519c-a879-d278aa8a48f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263188} :answer-field/id #uuid "44b24809-0a0e-5c7b-9ffd-2ce793b20dcd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265375}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "2038a353-9df5-5f59-a4d0-04cb2cfa4cea" :question/math-academy-id "q-130247" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand \n$$\n\\displaystyle B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $2$nd *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot 0+\\left(\\frac{-\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot 0+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 0 \\\\ 0\\cdot 0+0\\cdot 1+1\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292861 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "35a277db-ec1d-5339-9e82-45fd36df7e02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290850}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "35a277db-ec1d-5339-9e82-45fd36df7e02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290850} :answer-field/id #uuid "6d3641ea-9f18-5805-b931-3c38516383e8" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592