k the long way: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -\\sqrt{7} \\\\ 2\\sqrt{2} & \\sqrt{5} & -3.2 \\\\ \\sqrt{6} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{2} & \\sqrt{5} & -3.2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326919 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ef4229b-5170-582e-bd95-77863ec1fe95" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1.5 \\\\ -2\\sqrt{3} \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324230} {:answer/id #uuid "366fbef1-5b91-5e66-97d5-ccbd743c4dea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4\\sqrt{2} & 1.5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324415} {:answer/id #uuid "84b4e68e-08de-5c67-bbd4-321c8b2a7fac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -3.5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325090} {:answer/id #uuid "86d9259c-3949-5db0-9003-f1a82348b3a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 & -\\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325120} {:answer/id #uuid "fc705767-f381-5ed0-ad93-5efbdbb99971" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3.5 & -2\\sqrt{3} & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326192}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fc705767-f381-5ed0-ad93-5efbdbb99971" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3.5 & -2\\sqrt{3} & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326192} :answer-field/id #uuid "ec730f37-5c2e-54b5-bbb4-1fd945357ac7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326647}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "fc71896c-5daf-5e26-9560-8339a3f927a3" :question/math-academy-id "q-41979" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand \n$$\n\\displaystyle B=\\begin{bmatrix}4\\sqrt{2} & 1.5 & 2 \\\\ -3.5 & -2\\sqrt{3} & -3 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -\\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $A$ is the $2$nd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $B$ by the $2$nd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}$ on the *left*, the result must be the $2$nd *row* of $B.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}-3.5 & -2\\sqrt{3} & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4\\sqrt{2} & 1.5 & 2 \\\\ -3.5 & -2\\sqrt{3} & -3 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -\\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3.5 & -2\\sqrt{3} & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345087 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "005d0dc0-c679-52c6-abbc-b50e1a9c606d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342245} {:answer/id #uuid "1bade1d0-68d0-5f74-9071-e51229d51e1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342473} {:answer/id #uuid "23ad34dd-4dce-5431-b238-8e2f933f2ad9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342535} {:answer/id #uuid "24307cfa-00ed-5caf-8cf9-ec8ae54f022f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592