div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $2$nd *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{13} & -3 & 6 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{3} & -1 \\\\ 7 & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{13}\\cdot 0+(-3)\\cdot 1+6\\cdot 0 \\\\ 3\\cdot 0+\\sqrt{3}\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot 0 \\\\ 7\\cdot 0+(-1)\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186546083 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "346a9c36-9c70-5a26-a683-b26b85be243e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2\\sqrt{11} \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546084} {:answer/id #uuid "59c9f45b-de24-5684-9e28-4baa92ba5926" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3\\sqrt{6} & 6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546085} {:answer/id #uuid "8a367c8b-e09a-5e10-8f5d-0a988ff5dc84" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3\\sqrt{10} & -1 & 4.6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546088} {:answer/id #uuid "8e5b5143-6112-5bdb-a30c-e60d12cefc73" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4.6 \\\\ -1.7 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546089} {:answer/id #uuid "c22141b6-ad0a-5d40-b9aa-254caa95396e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3\\sqrt{10} \\\\ -4 \\\\ 3\\sqrt{6}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546091}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8e5b5143-6112-5bdb-a30c-e60d12cefc73" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4.6 \\\\ -1.7 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546089} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa2cb576-db76-5f72-8574-1fafaae20058" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186546094}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "2d472ae0-7d53-527e-b3ef-7cd75481083e" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}3\\sqrt{10} & -1 & 4.6 \\\\ -4 & 2\\sqrt{11} & -1.7 \\\\ 3\\sqrt{6} & 6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand \n$$\n\\displaystyle B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $3$rd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $3$rd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $3$rd *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}4.6 \\\\ -1.7 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}3\\sqrt{10} & -1 & 4.6 \\\\ -4 & 2\\sqrt{11} & -1.7 \\\\ 3\\sqrt{6} & 6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3\\sqrt{10}\\cdot 0+(-1)\\cdot 0+4.6\\cdot 1 \\\\ (-4)\\cdot 0+2\\sqrt{11}\\cdot 0+(-1.7)\\cdot 1 \\\\ 3\\sqrt{6}\\cdot 0+6\\cdot 0+9\\cdot 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4.6 \\\\ -1.7 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186602398 