 1 & -\\sqrt{3} \\\\ 2\\sqrt{2} & -3 & -3.2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $A$ is the $1$st *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $B$ by the $1$st *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}$ on the *left*, the result must be the $1$st *row* of $B.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 1 & -\\sqrt{3} \\\\ 2\\sqrt{2} & -3 & -3.2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186602405 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3deb735b-59de-514c-a9c5-d0a2f271c925" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602111}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3deb735b-59de-514c-a9c5-d0a2f271c925" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602111} :answer-field/id #uuid "05bea7b5-11b3-515f-9283-4276e9f589f1" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602307} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bb678d86-b647-5c73-832e-8fc5beb8f072" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602238}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bb678d86-b647-5c73-832e-8fc5beb8f072" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602238} :answer-field/id #uuid "1046c04d-395f-5394-9ed6-e9b3c0a3db15" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602312}