:answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602094} :answer-field/id #uuid "f31f942e-b532-5898-af70-f9fab3c827cc" :answer-field/key "field-8" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602390}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "213b2643-d369-585f-a935-32807ac38964" :question/math-academy-id "q-337657" :question/problem "Calculate the product ${I}_{3}D$ given that ${I}_{3}$ is the $3\\times 3$ identity matrix and\n$$\n\\displaystyle D=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 9 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">${I}_{3}\\cdot D=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-4}}</td><td>{{field-5}}</td><td>{{field-6}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-7}}</td><td>{{field-8}}</td><td>{{field-9}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Any matrix, when multiplied by an identity matrix, remains unchanged (assuming that the multiplication is well defined).\n\nThe matrix $D$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix and ${I}_{3}$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix too. \n\nTherefore, the multiplication is well defined and \n\n$$\n{I}_{3}\\cdot D=D=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 9 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186602418 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "273f1034-7493-5689-80b6-d9d8bb4de711" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sqrt{11}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602091}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "273f1034-7493-5689-80b6-d9d8bb4de711" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sqrt{11}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602091} :answer-field/id #uuid "279dca77-14c0-534d-bd5a-cbc0b1404831" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602320} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ef7d4cea-48e5-5126-afec-75abcf59374d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602287}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ef7d4cea-48e5-5126-afec-75abcf59374d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602287} :answer-field/id #uuid "5743b1a3-0dff-56dc-a5c7-6aee70e06c65" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602338} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f2ef71af-dc19-5280-9652-e6f2b73f7d18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ln(2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602291}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f2ef71af-dc19-5280-9652-e6f2b73f7d18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ln(2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602291} :answer-field/id #uuid "baa92b97-cd37-5bd8-89b0-056673466195" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602372} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "270dcdcf-34c7-59f5-9d85-d644909445b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{9}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602089}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "270dcdcf-34c7-59f5-9d85-d644909445b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{9}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602089} :answer-field/id #uuid "d3216cc2-3da0-53b6-a890-400ba45512ec" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186602379}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "667b91b1-e507-551a-b225-8b558b92d6a6" :question/math-academy-id "q-337672" :question/problem "Find the product $CD$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand \n$$\n\\displaystyle D=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & \\sqrt{2} & 10 & -\\frac{1}{5} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & -7 & \\pi  & 0 \\\\ 6 & -\\sqrt{11} & -\\frac{9}{4} & \\operatorname{ln}⁡(2) \\\\ 12 & -3 & \\sqrt{13} & -e\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$CD=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $C$ is the $3$rd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{4}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $4\\times 4$ matrix $D$ by the $3$rd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{4}$ on the *left*, the result must be the $3$rd *row* of $D.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nCD=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -\\sqrt{11} & -\\frac{9}{4} & \\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CD & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & \\sqrt{2} & 10 & -\\frac{1}{5} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & -7 & \\pi  & 0 \\\\ 6 & -\\sqrt{11} & -\\frac{9}{4} & \\operatorname{ln}⁡(2) \\\\ 12 & -3 & \\sqrt{13} & -e\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -\\sqrt{11} & -\\frac{9}{4} & \\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186659677 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "377f4f70-2061-5c3e-a072-b822505824c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659170} {:answer/id #uuid "3e74ad68-8d25-5172-8b8f-a2d6c3027385" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659178} {:answer/id #uuid "6b13e620-a0c7-5dc7-a9b6-8274d67554f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659273} {:answer/id #uuid "8b4e9906-a3a5-5a9f-9474-e6139d232871" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -2\\sqrt{7}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659329} {:answer/id #uuid "9012a237-3f4b-5b62-a98a-bffbee1876f9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5\\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\sqrt{3} \\\\ -2\\sqrt{7}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659337}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3e74ad68-8d25-5172-8b8f-a2d6c3027385" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659178} :answer-field/id #uuid "e452d4b0-1ee6-518b-b7b3-dc7240d5b309" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659647}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "1f646e33-2492-5ac7-bd9e-c7bb0102bc94" :question/math-academy-id "q-41895" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3} & \\sqrt{3} & -2\\sqrt{7}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand \n$$\n\\displaystyle B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $2$nd *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3} & \\sqrt{3} & -2\\sqrt{7}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 0+\\sqrt{2}\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 0 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 1+(-4)\\cdot 0 \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3}\\cdot 0+\\sqrt{3}\\cdot 1+(-2\\sqrt{7})\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186718890 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "37ab69a5-5d06-516f-bb06-99e27f4bfe9b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718881}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "37ab69a5-5d06-516f-bb06-99e27f4bfe9b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718881} :answer-field/id #uuid "57034cb0-8512-5a05-8138-9349ef0275b8" :answer-field/key "top-left" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718883} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e56d0e1-cb3b-5865-8a40-695d99e411f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718878}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0e56d0e1-cb3b-5865-8a40-695d99e411f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718878} :answer-field/id #uuid "62ea1a0b-3e09-5a1a-87c6-9812ae2b7250" :answer-field/key "bottom-left" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718886} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1367fa66-7811-5b6b-8c49-872df64436f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718879}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1367fa66-7811-5b6b-8c49-872df64436f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718879} :answer-field/id #uuid "cc2d682d-6753-52fe-beb6-3cbbc855c2b6" :answer-field/key "top-right" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718894} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e3c31f6f-412f-5287-8657-29a13478c61d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718898}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e3c31f6f-412f-5287-8657-29a13478c61d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718898} :answer-field/id #uuid "d1b79614-584f-5163-b848-97b18aa9bf16" :answer-field/key "bottom-right" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718895}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "adac652f-820b-5c82-b3d1-3eb2308405e7" :question/problem "Calculate $CB$ and enter its four entries.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$CB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{top-left}}</td><td>{{top-right}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{bottom-left}}</td><td>{{bottom-right}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "$C$ has ones on its diagonal and zeros elsewhere, so $C=I_2$. Both matrices are $2 \\times 2$, so the product is defined. Hence\n\n$$\nCB=I_2 B=B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFor example, the first row of $C$ selects the first row of $B$: its two entries are $1\\cdot3+0\\cdot0=3$ and $1\\cdot(-2)+0\\cdot5=-2$. The second row selects the second row of $B$, giving $0$ and $5$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186718897 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5e89c01c-ae1d-5806-ab4a-166ee6404955" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$AE=A$, because every entry of $E$ is $1$." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718884} {:answer/id #uuid "837a88be-07c2-5478-8b7e-52ffccd59ea2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$AE=A$, because matrix multiplication is commutative for all square matrices." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718888} {:answer/id #uuid "945cef1e-46fd-5e0c-8af8-8af4d81b5b4f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$AE=\\begin{bmatrix}a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{bmatrix}$, because multiplication by $E$ switches rows and columns." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718889} {:answer/id #uuid "b254fb76-4b94-5168-a8c2-9444953ae1f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$AE=A$, because each column of $E$ selects the corresponding entry from each row of $A$." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718891} {:answer/id #uuid "c94d1f8d-6c10-5d39-ad9c-5ce07dee3110" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$AE=\\begin{bmatrix}a & 0 \\\\ 0 & d\\end{bmatrix}$, because matrix multiplication multiplies corresponding entries." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718893}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b254fb76-4b94-5168-a8c2-9444953ae1f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$AE=A$, because each column of $E$ selects the corresponding entry from each row of $A$." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718891} :answer-field/id #uuid "d25a8a3b-32ab-5b44-849f-abf8394ed439" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718896}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "dd99c764-104f-5b5d-906a-fed5358659d7" :question/problem "Let $a,b,c,d$ be arbitrary real numbers, and let\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nA student claims that\n\n$$\nAE=\\begin{bmatrix}a & 0 \\\\ 0 & d\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nbecause the zero entries of $E$ erase the off-diagonal entries of $A$. Which correction gives both the correct product and a valid reason for **every** choice of $a,b,c,d$?" :question/worked-solution "$E$ is the identity matrix $I_2$. Matrix multiplication uses rows of the first matrix and columns of the second; it does not multiply corresponding entries.\n\n$$\nAE=\\begin{bmatrix}a\\cdot1+b\\cdot0 & a\\cdot0+b\\cdot1 \\\\ c\\cdot1+d\\cdot0 & c\\cdot0+d\\cdot1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{bmatrix}=A.\n$$\n\nEach column of $E$ selects the corresponding entry from each row of $A$. Thus the off-diagonal entries $b$ and $c$ are preserved too. The student used entrywise multiplication instead. For instance, $b=1$ makes the top-right entry of $AE$ equal to $1$, contradicting the claimed zero.\n\nThe product is unchanged because of the identity matrix, not because arbitrary matrix products commute or because $E$ has ones everywhere."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186718899 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d89ebd8-596a-51c9-b3ec-711087d429fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718877} {:answer/id #uuid "42d6009d-7b8d-5e5e-a600-51673eee6694" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718882} {:answer/id #uuid "61e861df-78b4-513e-b3f6-72138a6454ec" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The product is undefined" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718885} {:answer/id #uuid "66d0cd11-2104-5573-8f26-0ddc3e0b9742" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718887} {:answer/id #uuid "b37a6c2a-349e-57ea-9d60-7760b3233000" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718892}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "42d6009d-7b8d-5e5e-a600-51673eee6694" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718882} :answer-field/id #uuid "27dc4888-8c8c-51ae-99cd-e48b8a95ddee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186718880}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "e8b03ac8-9501-5f57-a179-6dda9aac429d" :question/problem "Calculate the product $A I_2$, given that $I_2$ is the $2 \\times 2$ identity matrix and\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Both $A$ and $I_2$ are $2 \\times 2$ matrices, so the product is defined. Multiplication by the corresponding identity matrix leaves a matrix unchanged. Therefore,\n\n$$\nA I_2=A=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719018 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ee762fa-b324-513b-b936-fd7b2795a621" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719020}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2ee762fa-b324-513b-b936-fd7b2795a621" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719020} :answer-field/id #uuid "3988d708-529f-5e7e-8114-a941035951f4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719024} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1bd763c-4c02-5e86-9eb3-51cc802de726" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719035}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c1bd763c-4c02-5e86-9eb3-51cc802de726" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719035} :answer-field/id #uuid "4b89d573-faff-5309-aa6c-c6f23b3b72a6" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719025} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7c9e54ca-c72c-5c48-aff7-5d10f5d7e232" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719029}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7c9e54ca-c72c-5c48-aff7-5d10f5d7e232" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719029} :answer-field/id #uuid "ad889906-c6af-5967-b627-3b5f4ff9b709" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719033}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "21b9679a-6126-5d76-a9e0-4b35f189b7f2" :question/problem "Find the product $CD$, if\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\sqrt{3} & \\frac{1}{2} & -6 \\\\ 4 & -5 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 2\\sqrt{2} & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nEnter the entries of the resulting row in order.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$CD=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $C$ is the first row of $I_3$. Multiplying $D$ by this row on the left selects the first row of $D$, so\n$$\nCD=\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\sqrt{3} & \\frac{1}{2} & -6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nEach entry is the dot product of $C$ with the corresponding column of $D$. From left to right, these entries are\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n1\\cdot(-2\\sqrt{3})+0\\cdot4+0\\cdot7 &= -2\\sqrt{3}, \\\\\n1\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}+0\\cdot(-5)+0\\cdot2\\sqrt{2} &= \\frac{1}{2}, \\\\\n1\\cdot(-6)+0\\cdot0+0\\cdot3 &= -6.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719026 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2c494c36-4d5a-5844-acbf-5cc08af13205" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719019} {:answer/id #uuid "306e69ae-39fa-5dbc-b90f-8bc66db08360" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719021} {:answer/id #uuid "b2989509-f2d2-5e34-9f51-1e0afeb23848" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 5 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719034} {:answer/id #uuid "c2d911f7-de83-5c53-b365-d3435947e100" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} & -\\sqrt{5} & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719036} {:answer/id #uuid "df33ca56-a0e5-56b3-b98d-328d74952f87" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719037}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "306e69ae-39fa-5dbc-b90f-8bc66db08360" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719021} :answer-field/id #uuid "36619b20-5af2-598d-b5c1-7c398acdef50" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719023}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "6394abf7-6f04-5053-a343-8b58585752a8" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & -3 & \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ 5 & 1 & -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ -4 & 6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n" :question/worked-solution "The vector $B$ is the third column of $I_3$. Multiplying $A$ by this column on the right selects the third column of $A$:\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nTo check by row-by-column multiplication:\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2}\\cdot0+(-3)\\cdot0+\\frac{7}{2}\\cdot1 \\\\ 5\\cdot0+1\\cdot0+(-\\sqrt{5})\\cdot1 \\\\ (-4)\\cdot0+6\\cdot0+2\\cdot1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719038 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "34b88b36-8549-5142-a9d7-1555ab729c6a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719022} {:answer/id #uuid "6fb764eb-3624-5bc8-a000-e7f9a47dcf42" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719027} {:answer/id #uuid "7ed5ea3c-3cac-589b-aa94-56878ed18719" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719030} {:answer/id #uuid "8f0c5d87-45fd-5601-a771-a19f41d96271" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719031} {:answer/id #uuid "939026d0-c3ad-5987-9096-f03227968a4c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719032}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8f0c5d87-45fd-5601-a771-a19f41d96271" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719031} :answer-field/id #uuid "752b8425-fba5-5416-ad03-96b29ddcaa9e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719028}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "df36c768-19ab-5b92-8fc5-34754f2d10d7" :question/problem "Calculate the product $(LM)R$, where\n$$\nL=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 7 & 3 & -6 \\\\ -8 & -4 & 9\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\nand\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nSelect the resulting $1\\times1$ matrix." :question/worked-solution "First, $L$ is the third row of $I_3$, so multiplying on the left selects the third row of $M$:\n$$\nLM=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & -4 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nNext, $R$ is the second column of $I_3$. Multiplying on the right selects the second column of that row. The result is a $1\\times1$ matrix:\n$$\n(LM)R=\\begin{bmatrix}-4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nTo check the final multiplication, the single entry is the dot product\n$$\n(-8)\\cdot0+(-4)\\cdot1+9\\cdot0=-4.\n$$\nBoth selectors matter: the row selector chooses row $3$, and the column selector chooses column $2$. The selected entry is $M_{32}=-4$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719211 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "33b489a5-2d80-5199-be4f-772009829879" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -6 & 6 \\\\ -4 & 5 & -6 \\\\ -6 & -2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719224} {:answer/id #uuid "39f10352-97dd-52cf-95d7-b87f90ef278b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -6 & 3 \\\\ -6 & 5 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719225} {:answer/id #uuid "5864610a-467b-57ee-8cc5-50126f3b415d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -6 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 5 & -4 \\\\ 3 & -2 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719228} {:answer/id #uuid "66cace4c-1a91-5a13-a20c-c4b01c892887" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -4 & -6 \\\\ -6 & 5 & -2 \\\\ 6 & -6 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719231} {:answer/id #uuid "763befd9-9db2-53a9-8c91-51324d59f0f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -4 & 5 & -6 \\\\ -1 & -6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719235}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "39f10352-97dd-52cf-95d7-b87f90ef278b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -6 & 3 \\\\ -6 & 5 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719225} :answer-field/id #uuid "4668dd17-5aa9-5ab1-bfc1-130f70510984" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719226}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "0393b7cc-d444-549e-8e90-a0de79cc8aef" :question/problem "Calculate $MI_3$, given that $I_3$ is the $3 \\times 3$ identity matrix.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -6 & 3 \\\\ -6 & 5 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "$I_3$ is the corresponding identity matrix. Both matrices are $3 \\times 3$, so the product is defined. Multiplication by the corresponding identity leaves every entry unchanged.\n\n$$\nMI_3=M=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -6 & 3 \\\\ -6 & 5 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719221 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0db1f584-8662-5e2c-8c5e-393c677a7dfc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719213} {:answer/id #uuid "27a610c8-1a07-5fd6-8a03-e3b998ecceb3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 5 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719222} {:answer/id #uuid "7585b846-2bf6-5f81-bf67-659b11fa5354" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -4 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719234} {:answer/id #uuid "b339a581-610b-5e31-a9d7-a9000a78d60a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719242} {:answer/id #uuid "ebbda360-e9e6-5c1e-8f6e-bf98614c2709" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}