iv class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 & -2 \\\\ -5 & -6 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$ME=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{entry-1-1}}</td><td>{{entry-1-2}}</td><td>{{entry-1-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{entry-2-1}}</td><td>{{entry-2-2}}</td><td>{{entry-2-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{entry-3-1}}</td><td>{{entry-3-2}}</td><td>{{entry-3-3}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "$E$ has ones on its diagonal and zeros elsewhere, so $E=I_3$. Both matrices are $3 \\times 3$, so the product is defined. Multiplication by the corresponding identity leaves every entry unchanged.\n\n$$\nME=M=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 & -2 \\\\ -5 & -6 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFor example, its first entry is $(3)\\cdot1+(-5)\\cdot0+(-2)\\cdot0=3$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719622 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d6163ec-0bb7-5a4b-b379-e604ec8839bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719616} {:answer/id #uuid "55665bbe-f9d4-5ec2-a2f0-8388f80431fa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719625} {:answer/id #uuid "668b57f5-935f-5de4-a4ab-f5fe42d984f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719629} {:answer/id #uuid "6d69c73c-19f3-5e61-bbaa-c421738c78c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :a